{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-02_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-02","title":"兵不接刃","storyCode":"2-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"90f1452ae29f05fbddc5e730142068596abc26b472a556830723c5095eef2598","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——以上就是此次戰鬥的全過程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你的評價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的實力確實合格了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但魏長官，無論是在戰略層面，還是關於他們的身份，我都認為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門近衛局完全可以勝任接下來的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"對抗犯罪與侵略，近衛局綽綽有餘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然羅德島也能提供更多的可能性。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島所要求的“東西”裡有一樣，可不是目前羅德島給出的條件可以交換的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是僅僅在臨時防衛上的合作，也完全無法與之等價。相比之下，羅德島的“要價”有點太高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我想凱爾希小姐和阿米婭小姐很清楚吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，僅僅防衛是不夠的。整合運動還有很多你不知道的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我們交戰的情況推測，若不採取主動措施，整合運動將在未來數周內攻陷龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......危言聳聽。沒有任何證據可以表明——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官，想知道切爾諾伯格一夜失陷的真正原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不僅親歷了切爾諾伯格事件，而且......我們經歷了天災，並且自災難中活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，真是，令人尊敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"除了一些不要命的狂人，我還真沒見到過多少人能從天災中倖存呢。阿米婭小姐，請繼續說，我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們與整合運動的領袖交過手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？她的名字是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得不是那麼清楚了......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"塔露拉","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是的，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官，你認為呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我——知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就是羅德島在切爾諾伯格的經歷。遭受天災的切城雖然脫離了烏薩斯的控制————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們會需要擴張，此時仍然有大量物資缺口。而龍門是他們的下一個跳板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然龍門的確可以阻止一系列破壞行動，如果無法在未來主動出擊的話，整合運動對龍門的攻擊將持續不斷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......最難以搞清楚的，其實是失去了切城的烏薩斯帝國他們對此事的態度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......小姑娘，你說的不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"出於局勢緊張，以及龍門近衛局人手有限，我可以以之前的臨時協議為基礎，考慮一下你們的具體方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"但正如我剛才所說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島的要價太高，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"正是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"為了彌補龍門的支出，我的條件啊，也很簡單，只有兩條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，羅德島必須幫助近衛局解除整合運動對龍門的威脅。其中包括確認龍門內的威脅以及處理關於切城的相關問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"還有所謂的感染者的滲透狀況什麼的。總之無論有什麼樣的有利情報，我需要你們同步共用給龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——那，第二個要求是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"第二個，要等你們完成了首要任務再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我的要求，不會超出羅德島的能力範疇及業務內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不能理解。我希望魏先生詳細解釋一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那就這麼說吧。如果整合運動造成了超過羅德島預期的損害——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望羅德島能夠協助近衛局，妥善處理，甚至參與某些部分的善後。當然，也在你們的能力範圍內。這是大致的內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個點上，我尚不能細說。不過請不要忘了，羅德島沒有選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能接受，那麼我覺得我們之前的所有說的條件，以及你們想要的都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，我希望將這一條也寫入合約......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“在詮釋條例時，由雙方共同參與討論。”————這樣可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦......當然可以。這是對龍門的尊重呢，阿米婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官，你有什麼意見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——我認可這次行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"看來陳警官也有了她自己的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——恭喜各位，龍門信任你們。陳警官將全權負責和你們的對接事宜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，感染者自由行動會引起市民的恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你們在執行任務時，能服從龍門近衛局————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是陳警司的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門的關口將向羅德島敞開，只要你們一切的行動都在正軌上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......啊......！那個大叔超難對付的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"講起話來慢條斯理，感覺他完全不為所動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你總得學會自己與他們交涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，你做的還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我認識你嗎，凱爾希？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......你好，凱爾希醫生。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"初次見面，Dr.凱爾希","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，請別為難博士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我們之前的犧牲......能有所回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]}]}
